Why AGPL-3.0 for CITADEL
========================

CITADEL is the trust root of the OpenSecStack ecosystem. Its WORM audit
chain and MARSHAL governance gates are what downstream platforms — and
ultimately regulators — rely on for tamper-evident evidence. AGPL-3.0
ensures that any modified version operated as a network service must
publish its source to its users. This prevents a closed-source fork of
the governance layer from diverging silently from the upstream audit
semantics. Tool platforms in this repository (APIGuard, ThreatFlow,
SDKs) remain Apache-2.0 — the copyleft obligation is scoped to the
governance core by design.
